{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And he rebuked</b> — Twice in the Masorah: here and the other: <b>ויגער בים סוף ויחרב</b>. To teach you: just as the <b>ויגער</b> here is Jacob, so the <b>ויגער</b> there refers to Jacob, in whose merit the sea was dried up. And this is what they expounded: <b>וירא ישראל</b> — Israel the elder."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:49.595936029Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}